      "text": "outputs = [\n  x[0]*w[0][0] + x[1]*w[0][1]\n  + x[2]*w[0][2] + x[3]*w[0][3]\n  + b[0],\n\n  x[0]*w[1][0] + x[1]*w[1][1]\n  + x[2]*w[1][2] + x[3]*w[1][3]\n  + b[1],\n\n  # ... again for neuron 3\n]",
